  "description": "60\" Length heavy-duty clamp on pallet porks, 2000lbs capacity with Adjustable Stabilizer Bar compatible for Loader Bucket Skidsteer Tractor.\nFitment\nIt is an essential piece of farm equipment. Compatible with most loader bucket skid steer tractors. Widely used to move fence posts, lumber, pallets, and logs around.\nFor your safety, professional installation recommended.\nFeatures\nUse it for your farming and agricultural needs.\nIt comes with an adjustable stabilizer bar. It can be adjusted from 18\" to 34\" W.\nMade from coated welded steel construction, durable and reliable.\nMax capacity loads up to 2000 pounds, easily move large items or fully loaded pallets.\nThere are rollback protection slots and chain holes for secure and safe lifting.\nWith these heavy-duty 62 pounds clamp-on pallet form sets, enjoy easier loading of heavy items.\nEasy to install, simply slide the fork over the cutting edge of the bucket, and clamp it down to lock.",
